(4) column read of a 32 x 32 float tile: threads on the busiest bank
    plain       addr = row*32 + col              : 32
    padded      addr = row*33 + col              : 1
    swizzled    addr = row*32 + (col XOR row)     : 1
    swizzle is a permutation of every row: yes; extra words: plain 0, padded 32, swizzled 0
